{
  "_system": [
    "ONE DRAWING PER MODULE, AUTHORED. The same hand as the specimen art and the",
    "same 48-unit grid, with one thing added: flat colour.",
    "",
    "A path is either a bare string (stroke only) or a [d, role] pair. The roles",
    "are fill, tint and deep, and none of them names a colour — they resolve",
    "against the module's own world palette, so a drawing inherits its hue and",
    "dark mode for nothing and cannot invent a colour the generator never gated.",
    "hatch is a half-weight stroke, for the shading that makes a hand-drawn",
    "diagram read as drawn rather than filled.",
    "",
    "RULES, checked by tools/build.mjs rather than remembered:",
    "48x48 grid, safe area 4..44. Absolute path commands only. One stroke weight,",
    "set in CSS. Fills BEFORE lines, so the line work always sits on top. At most",
    "14 paths — past that it stops reading at 64px, which is the size it is used",
    "at. One subject, centred, side-on, no perspective.",
    "",
    "Draw the module's IDEA, never its title. Cells is not a cell: it is a wall",
    "with something getting through it."
  ],
